{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/royal-golf-boutique-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":856,"crm_id":null,"search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Royal Golf Boutique Villas","slug":"royal-golf-boutique-villas","display_address":"Jumeirah Golf Estates","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Damac Properties","price":6541000,"display_price":"6.541M","lattitude":25.0199891,"longitude":55.2004893,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":7,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Royal Golf Boutique Villas, by Damac, are nestled ideally within Jumeirah Golf Estates. Every villa is distinct, unique and tastefully designed. Offering a choice of 5 different layouts and ranging from <strong>4 – 7 bedroom</strong> and <strong>up to 5 reception rooms.&nbsp;</strong></p><p>The villas boast Spanish architectural inspiration with terracotta roofs that slope gently, windows that are beautifully arched, and wrought-iron design structures. Many of the villas have their private swimming pools and huge gardens that blend into the green surroundings of the community. Located in Jumeirah Golf Estate, residents at Royal Golf Boutique Villas will have access to 2 Greg Nirman designed golf courses, Fire &amp; Earth, running tracks, gym, swimming pool and Tennis Academy with floodlights usta-standard hard court. The kids have schools and play areas for them. It is close to Business Bay, Dubai International Airport, Dubai Media City, Dubai Marina, and Al Maktoum International Airport. Perfectly placed within tranquillity and peace.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/royal_feature_254eb01a66.jpg","hash":"royal_feature_254eb01a66","name":"Royal Golf Boutique Villas"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/royal_banner_d2b33a7